## Third-party / upstream

| Asset | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| Light Bank `assets/human.svg` / `inhuman.svg` | Simplified outlines derived from public DEF CON 34 carrier KiCad on [media.defcon.org](https://media.defcon.org/DEF%20CON%2034/DEF%20CON%2034%20badge/). Not a full redesign redistribution. |
| Light Bank `uber.svg` | Approximate silhouette; Uber KiCad unpublished. |
| Upstream badge firmware / silicon / vault scheme | See the respective GitHub / media licenses (e.g. CERN OHL-W-2.0 for [dc34-core-hw](https://github.com/bunnie/dc34-core-hw)). |
| Conference light key `k0` | Community-shared after the hunt so breeding stays playable; not an official Baochip drop. |

This project is **not** an official DEF CON, Baochip, or CHEESO product.
